00:13:11.257 --> 00:13:13.419
What the hell were you thinking?!

00:13:14.393 --> 00:13:16.054
Speak up!

00:13:16.228 --> 00:13:18.060
Hey! Why don't you say something?!

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:20.494
Platform sandal kick!

00:13:21.801 --> 00:13:24.600
What the hell are you guys
doing to my friend?!

00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:26.515
Miss Kotobuki, please stop!

00:13:26.539 --> 00:13:28.871
These people helped me.

00:13:29.141 --> 00:13:30.006
What the heck?

00:13:34.146 --> 00:13:36.012
How are you gonna make it up to me?!

00:13:36.315 --> 00:13:37.282
For this?!

00:13:37.516 --> 00:13:40.262
What's going on here? Tell me everything.

00:13:40.286 --> 00:13:41.663
Hey, don't ignore me!

00:13:41.687 --> 00:13:44.156
We were waiting for the light to turn green,

00:13:44.723 --> 00:13:47.469
when she started crossing with a
brooding look on her face.

00:13:47.493 --> 00:13:51.157
And we saved her from getting run over.

00:13:57.102 --> 00:13:59.161
She was definitely in suicide-mode.

00:13:59.538 --> 00:14:00.949
Suicide?!

00:14:00.973 --> 00:14:03.652
No, that's not it. I was just a little spaced out.

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:05.872
Takazawa, what happened?

00:14:06.111 --> 00:14:07.455
Nothing.

00:14:07.479 --> 00:14:10.847
If it's nothing, why the heck
would you miss the stoplight?!

00:14:12.451 --> 00:14:14.496
I'm not a psychic, you know.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:17.785
| can't do anything for you,
if you won't talk to me!

00:14:18.123 --> 00:14:22.219
Say, I know we're not much,
but if you want our help, we're here.

00:14:27.733 --> 00:14:30.212
Takazawa, don't keep all your
problems to yourself.

00:14:30.236 --> 00:14:32.227
We're friends, aren't we?

00:14:38.377 --> 00:14:41.472
| was told to get a hold of your weakness,

00:14:42.014 --> 00:14:44.881
and he'd stop the silent treatment if I did.

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:46.575
Gunjo...

00:14:46.819 --> 00:14:51.188
But there was no way I could betray you,
Miss Kotobuki.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:54.826
And when I realized that,
| just didn't know what to do anymore.

00:14:55.527 --> 00:14:57.222
Damn that Gunjo!

00:14:57.396 --> 00:14:59.262
Talk about a nasty teacher!

00:15:00.165 --> 00:15:01.792
Miss Takazawa...

00:15:01.867 --> 00:15:03.801
Thanks for talking to us.

00:15:05.471 --> 00:15:07.303
That's the sign of a true friend.

00:15:07.573 --> 00:15:09.200
Miss Kotobuki...

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:13.021
Here you go.

00:15:13.045 --> 00:15:15.241
Ran, I'm going to walk
Miss Takazawa home.

00:15:15.614 --> 00:15:17.525
I'm counting on you.

00:15:17.549 --> 00:15:19.527
Don't give in to that bastard Gunjo!

00:15:19.551 --> 00:15:22.063
If the going gets tough,
drop by Shibuya anytime!

00:15:22.087 --> 00:15:25.648
We'll let you join our group,
even if you're not a tan-face!

00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:36.562
Shoot!

00:15:39.471 --> 00:15:40.982
<i>Takazawa!</i>

00:15:41.006 --> 00:15:42.701
Morning!

00:15:43.175 --> 00:15:44.853
Morning!

00:15:44.877 --> 00:15:46.606
Shoot! Later!

00:15:49.415 --> 00:15:50.905
In before the bell!

00:15:51.517 --> 00:15:52.712
Morning!

00:15:53.018 --> 00:15:54.296
Morning!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.298
Hey, hey, Ran.

00:15:56.322 --> 00:15:58.033
Since it's raining today,

00:15:58.057 --> 00:16:01.069
Gunjo's P.E. class is being turned into
an hour of morality.

00:16:01.093 --> 00:16:02.203
Morality?!

00:16:02.227 --> 00:16:04.924
It sounds like he might launch a
concentrated attack against you.

00:16:05.164 --> 00:16:07.258
Well, what happens will happen.

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:14.916
Right, Takazawa?

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:18.001
Yesterday, I found some
real leather boots!

00:16:20.312 --> 00:16:20.956
Later.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:21.856
Buh-bye.
Later.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:22.642
Buh-bye.

00:16:22.915 --> 00:16:24.747
Hurry up and get in your seats!

00:16:24.984 --> 00:16:26.748
We're starting class!

00:16:28.854 --> 00:16:30.799
I'd like for us to do something
different today

00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:32.767
and think about the school regulations.

00:16:32.791 --> 00:16:34.486
Kotobuki, stand up.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:39.828
What do you think of the school regulations?

00:16:43.068 --> 00:16:45.696
Maybe that question was too cruel for you.

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:51.070
Bleached and dyed hair, earrings and
other accessories, loose socks...

00:16:51.443 --> 00:16:54.845
Kotobuki, you're breaking quite a few
school regulations there.

00:16:55.814 --> 00:16:58.442
Do you think it's okay to not follow
school regulations?

00:16:59.585 --> 00:17:03.044
Do you all think nothing of the way
Kotobuki dresses?

00:17:04.156 --> 00:17:06.501
They say, "Disorderly attire is
the sign of a disorderly mind."

00:17:06.525 --> 00:17:09.051
Take a good look! Here's an
example of it right here!

00:17:10.095 --> 00:17:12.340
If you are proper and modest,

00:17:12.364 --> 00:17:14.743
you would never think to dress like this!

00:17:14.767 --> 00:17:18.135
Take a look at my class! I don't have
one problem child like her!

00:17:18.504 --> 00:17:21.337
Even though there's a huge problem
with the teacher.

00:17:22.074 --> 00:17:25.044
Goodness! You don't even know how to
properly address a teacher.

00:17:25.344 --> 00:17:28.006
Kotobuki, you are mold,
growing in the school.

00:17:28.847 --> 00:17:31.145
Mold has to be wiped away completely.

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:34.315
And you've got a gold leaf exterior.

00:17:34.653 --> 00:17:35.663
Gold leaf exterior?

00:17:35.687 --> 00:17:37.532
At first sight, you look all
gold and shiny,

00:17:37.556 --> 00:17:39.524
but peel away a layer and
there's nothing but rust.

00:17:39.758 --> 00:17:40.468
Right?

00:17:40.492 --> 00:17:43.605
Your brain's behind the times,
so I'll spell it out for you.

00:17:43.629 --> 00:17:47.759
These days, it's normal for students
not to say what they think.

00:17:47.933 --> 00:17:48.943
What?

00:17:48.967 --> 00:17:51.846
Your students in Class 4 do
what you tell them to,

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.448
but it's not because they respect you.

00:17:53.472 --> 00:17:54.449
Shut up.
but it's not because they respect you.

00:17:54.473 --> 00:17:55.116
Shut up.
| wonder if they'll still listen to you,

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:56.518
| wonder if they'll still listen to you,

00:17:56.542 --> 00:17:58.510
when your teacher's gold leaf exterior falls off?

00:17:58.577 --> 00:18:00.477
Shut up!

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.940
Ran, are you okay?!

00:18:06.351 --> 00:18:08.496
Leave her there. We're continuing the class.

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.079
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:18:10.255 --> 00:18:13.068
There's nothing wrong with doling out physical
punishment when talking won't do the job!

00:18:13.092 --> 00:18:15.220
Physical punishment?!
When talking won't do the job?!

00:18:15.427 --> 00:18:16.771
You bastard, just because she
touched a sore spot...

00:18:16.795 --> 00:18:18.506
Miyu...

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.241
You stay out of this.

00:18:20.265 --> 00:18:22.233
It's bad enough that I'll be
going down with him for this.

00:18:22.734 --> 00:18:23.778
Ran...

00:18:23.802 --> 00:18:25.447
Going down?

00:18:25.471 --> 00:18:27.735
Me, a teacher, with a problem child?

00:18:29.007 --> 00:18:30.475
Ridiculous.

00:18:31.176 --> 00:18:33.321
What happened, Mr. Gunjo?

00:18:33.345 --> 00:18:35.541
| heard a really loud noise.

00:18:35.681 --> 00:18:37.692
Oh, it's nothing.

00:18:37.716 --> 00:18:39.661
Please go back to your class.

00:18:39.685 --> 00:18:40.662
But...

00:18:40.686 --> 00:18:44.213
That's right, I'm nothing.

00:18:45.224 --> 00:18:46.701
Naka-Teach...

00:18:46.725 --> 00:18:49.319
Kotobuki, are you hurt?!

00:18:50.462 --> 00:18:52.974
A bruise like this will go away after a while,

00:18:52.998 --> 00:18:57.299
but you left a huge bruise on one of
your students' feelings!

00:18:58.003 --> 00:19:00.995
Do you even realize that, you big moron?!

00:19:15.587 --> 00:19:18.056
Kotobuki, why you...

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:19.367
Gunjo, you bastard!

00:19:19.391 --> 00:19:21.636
Have you ever believed in your students,
even just once?!

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.837
Stop it, Kotobuki!

00:19:22.861 --> 00:19:27.958
Do you know how much Takazawa's
suffering because of you?!

00:19:28.467 --> 00:19:30.979
Takazawa? You mean
the Takazawa in Class 4?

00:19:31.003 --> 00:19:32.732
What about her?

00:19:33.038 --> 00:19:34.733
It's nothing, Mr. Nakanishi.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:36.651
But...

00:19:36.675 --> 00:19:40.722
Kotobuki, you better be prepared
for the consequences

00:19:40.746 --> 00:19:42.714
for using violence against a teacher.

00:19:42.781 --> 00:19:45.409
Hold me back or expel me, I don't care!

00:19:45.918 --> 00:19:49.684
But not before I totally tear that
gold leaf exterior off of you!

00:19:50.222 --> 00:19:51.533
Kotobuki!

00:19:51.557 --> 00:19:55.336
Mr. Nakanishi, I reprimanded Kotobuki
on her lifestyle and attitude,

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:59.524
and now she's trying to get back at me
by making false accusations!

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:00.642
| can't believe this!

00:20:00.666 --> 00:20:04.045
The students in your class have probably
already caught on to you by now!

00:20:04.069 --> 00:20:06.936
They're just flinching away
from your fake brilliance!

00:20:07.306 --> 00:20:10.276
But the great Ran isn't gonna give an inch!

00:20:10.642 --> 00:20:12.804
Don't underestimate the power of gals!

00:20:13.111 --> 00:20:14.322
What are you talking about?!

00:20:14.346 --> 00:20:15.924
My educational principles are not wrong!

00:20:15.948 --> 00:20:16.424
What Miss Kotobuki said is the truth.
My educational principles are not wrong!

00:20:16.448 --> 00:20:19.042
What Miss Kotobuki said is the truth.

00:20:19.418 --> 00:20:20.128
Takazawa...

00:20:20.152 --> 00:20:21.062
Mr. Nakanishi, I...
Takazawa...

00:20:21.086 --> 00:20:21.629
Mr. Nakanishi, I...

00:20:21.653 --> 00:20:23.815
We're in the middle of class,
go back to your classroom!

00:20:24.223 --> 00:20:27.001
| was told that it was my fault
that we lost at the sports fest

00:20:27.025 --> 00:20:30.772
and Mr. Gunjo ordered everyone
in the class to ignore me.

00:20:30.796 --> 00:20:31.940
That's not true!

00:20:31.964 --> 00:20:34.592
Mr. Nakanishi, I never said anything like that!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.196
Takazawa, enough with the lies!

00:20:37.636 --> 00:20:41.349
It may be true that we lost
the sports fest because of me,

00:20:41.373 --> 00:20:45.653
but it's impossible for us to work hard
for a teacher who doesn't believe in us!

00:20:45.677 --> 00:20:47.304
<i>Takazawa!</i>

00:20:47.679 --> 00:20:50.376
Mr. Gunjo never says anything directly.

00:20:51.516 --> 00:20:52.694
He tells us in a roundabout way

00:20:52.718 --> 00:20:54.329
to give Miss Takazawa the silent treatment,

00:20:54.353 --> 00:20:57.550
that if you don't, you'll be next.

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.601
You...

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:02.651
| was told the same thing, by Mr. Gunjo.

00:21:03.462 --> 00:21:06.261
That's a lie! I never said anything like that!

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.500
Mr. Nakanishi, who are you going
to believe?! Me or them?!

00:21:13.705 --> 00:21:15.673
The gold leaf exterior's been torn off.

00:21:27.753 --> 00:21:31.747
In the end, I was only placed
under suspension for five days.

00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:34.035
Normally, I would've been expelled,

00:21:34.059 --> 00:21:36.926
but Naka-Teach apparently appealed
to the principal for me.

00:21:37.229 --> 00:21:41.309
Real teachers without gold leaf
exteriors sure are different.

00:21:41.333 --> 00:21:44.846
| got lectured and given the
giant swing treatment from Pops,

00:21:44.870 --> 00:21:48.101
but the toughest part was the
50-page repentance essay.

00:21:49.174 --> 00:21:52.007
But well, with everyone's help,
| managed to get it done,

00:21:52.277 --> 00:21:54.322
and with testimonies from the students,

00:21:54.346 --> 00:21:57.839
Gunjo got suspended from work
and it was happily ever after.

00:21:58.283 --> 00:21:59.842
Or, it was supposed to be, but...

00:22:01.753 --> 00:22:03.221
Something's not right.

00:22:04.323 --> 00:22:05.833
It's a well-written essay,

00:22:05.857 --> 00:22:08.417
but I find it hard to believe that you wrote it.
Something's fishy.

00:22:08.593 --> 00:22:10.071
Come on, that's my honest
to goodness handwriting!

00:22:10.095 --> 00:22:11.506
Oh, please, Naka-Teach!

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.574
Maybe you're just underestimating
my Japanese skills.

00:22:13.598 --> 00:22:14.809
Then, let me ask you...

00:22:14.833 --> 00:22:16.824
How do you read this word?!

00:22:16.902 --> 00:22:18.370
To Strive

00:22:22.507 --> 00:22:24.976
Can't you even read the words
that you wrote yourself?!

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.142
Well...

00:22:27.346 --> 00:22:28.108
NVd DINGOLOM
HOd AT3AISNTOX3

00:22:28.313 --> 00:22:31.025
You're rewriting the repentance essay!

00:22:31.049 --> 00:22:35.247
The evil in this world has never
prospered to this day!

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:41.903
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:41.927 --> 00:22:48.128
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.567 --> 00:22:54.700
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.906 --> 00:23:00.208
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.179 --> 00:23:07.428
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.452 --> 00:23:13.221
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.792 --> 00:23:19.856
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:25.536
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.837 --> 00:23:31.799
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.177 --> 00:23:37.792
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.816 --> 00:23:45.155
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.357 --> 00:23:50.955
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.296 --> 00:23:57.759
If only I had more courage

00:23:57.969 --> 00:24:04.375
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.521
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.545 --> 00:24:08.222
Next Super GALS!
Sacred lots, tarot cards, and horoscopes.

00:24:08.246 --> 00:24:09.023
Next Super GALS!
There are all sorts of ways to tell your fortune,

00:24:09.047 --> 00:24:09.624
There are all sorts of ways to tell your fortune,

00:24:09.648 --> 00:24:10.792
but the most accurate fortune in this world

00:24:10.816 --> 00:24:12.593
is the sizzling, grilling steak fortune telling!

00:24:12.617 --> 00:24:14.585
If you're lucky, you win big
at the lottery in one try!

00:24:14.753 --> 00:24:16.731
But life isn't always one
good thing after another!

00:24:16.755 --> 00:24:19.452
If you're unlucky, a car's coming,
headed straight for you!

00:24:19.558 --> 00:24:20.968
Like hell I'm gonna get run over and
kick the bucket!

00:24:20.992 --> 00:24:22.770
| don't want my fortune,
| don't wanna look!

00:24:22.794 --> 00:24:26.458
Is breaking up with Tatsukichi
the only way I can escape this fate?

